      "title": "Golden Round",
      "tier": "LuV",
      "desc": "The Golden Round is the only ammunition the Golden Gun will take: a 9mm bullet dressed in gold. One round is one shot, so you will want a pile of them.\n\nMake them in a LuV Assembler from a 9mm bullet, two gold foils and a gold plate, in 10 seconds. The 9mm bullet itself comes from your LV Ammo Press, so keep that line running. NEI shows the circuit that selects the recipe.",
