    {
      "key": "gg.luv.golden_gun",
      "title": "Golden Gun",
      "tier": "LuV",
      "desc": "One shot, one kill. A hit from the Golden Gun kills a living creature outright, and against a boss it takes half of the boss's maximum health. It is a semi-automatic pistol with a one-round chamber, a slow reload and a lot of attitude.\n\nYou make it in the LuV Assembler from a 9mm Pistol, eight gold plates, two LuV circuits and an HSS-G plate. The pistol is used up and the Golden Gun comes out unloaded. Its ammo is the Golden Round from the previous quest.\n\n[note]Creatures that carry damage resistances can still shrug off a hit. Check the tooltip.[/note]",
