      "key": "gg.luv.nether_charge",
      "title": "Nether Charge",
      "tier": "LuV",
      "desc": "The Nether Charge is a small, nasty explosive packed with netherrack and soul sand. The Nether Blaster fires it, and it blows a small area apart.\n\nIt is an Assembly Line recipe: netherrack dust, soul sand, HSS-G plates, a LuV circuit, gunpowder and 4,000 mB of lava make sixteen charges in 20 seconds. The research item is an Advanced Bullet, so scan one in a Research Station first. NEI lists the full recipe.\n\n[warn]Charges are explosives. Store them away from your furnaces and your temper.[/warn]",
      "pre": [
        "gg.luv.intro"
      ],
