      "key": "gg.luv.grim_reaper",
      "title": "Grim Reaper",
      "tier": "LuV",
      "desc": "Four rocket tubes in one frame. The Grim Reaper holds four rockets and is the heaviest close-range weapon you can build before ZPM.\n\nIt is an upgrade in the LuV Assembler: a Rocket Launcher, three Hardened Steel Barrels for the other tubes, a Carbon Receiver, a LuV electric piston and four HSS-G plates. The launcher is used up. Its ammo is the same Rocket you made at HV.\n\n[warn]The blast radius is the same as the Rocket Launcher's, and four rockets in a row are four chances to hurt yourself.[/warn]",
